{"id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-teller.md","title":"真理陈述者句子 tau","display":"df-truth-teller — 真理陈述者句子 tau","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-teller","aliases":["91-df-truth-teller","91-df-truth-teller-sentence"],"display":"df-truth-teller — 真理陈述者句子 tau","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-self-reference]]","[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-teller"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-teller</span><span>91-df-truth-teller-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-teller — 真理陈述者句子 tau"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"78bf2ec267a1c34b\" href=\"?note=78bf2ec267a1c34b\" title=\"91-df-self-reference\">91-df-self-reference</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" href=\"?note=ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" title=\"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth\">91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-teller-—-真理陈述者句子-$\\tau$\">df-truth-teller — 真理陈述者句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (含真理谓词的可算语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span> (可表示句法运算的算术背景理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\\)</span> (该背景理论满足对角引理)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TruthTeller}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\n\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\tau\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\n\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TruthTeller}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\n\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\tau\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\n\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\,\n\\operatorname{TruthTeller}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\,\n\\operatorname{TruthTeller}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>任取满足该关系的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，即可作为一个真理陈述者；定义不声称其唯一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> : 真理陈述者（Truth Teller）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner})\\)</span> : &quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>是真的&quot;</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> : 等价</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：真理陈述者<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>是说&quot;我是真的&quot;的自指句子。其形式定义是通过取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x) = T(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x) = T(x)\\)</span>应用对角线引理得到的固定点。与说谎者句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>的区别在于：说谎者通过<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(x)\">\\(\\neg T(x)\\)</span>构造（否定自指），真理陈述者通过<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(x)\">\\(T(x)\\)</span>构造（肯定自指）。</p>\n<p>真理陈述者与说谎者的对比：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>说谎者<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span></th>\n<th>真理陈述者<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>定义</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner})\">\\(\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner})\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau \\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau \\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner})\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自指类型</td>\n<td>否定自指</td>\n<td>肯定自指</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>透明经典理论</td>\n<td>全语言 T-schema 下导致矛盾</td>\n<td>方程本身不导致矛盾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致强 Kleene 固定点</td>\n<td>稳定间隙</td>\n<td>可随固定点取真、假或间隙</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>真理陈述者的特殊性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真理陈述者方程本身不强制唯一值；具体扩张的一致性仍须验证</li>\n<li>固定点方程本身允许确定值与未定义值；哪些赋值实际出现取决于所选跳跃算子及固定点类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>在最小固定点中无确定真值（间隙）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>在不同固定点中可取不同真值（不稳定）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理理论的处理：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>的状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>强 Kleene 固定点为意向语义、对象逻辑经典</td>\n<td>间隙（在最小固定点中）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>由其超赋值式语义与具体公理处理</td>\n<td>不能由定义单独决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>经典对象逻辑配合受控真理规则</td>\n<td>不能仅凭排中律决定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>展示自指不一定导致悖论</li>\n<li>作为固定点非唯一性的证据</li>\n<li>区分&quot;悖论性&quot;与&quot;不确定性&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-teller-—-真理陈述者句子-$\\tau$","text":"df-truth-teller — 真理陈述者句子 $\\tau$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-self-reference","status":"resolved","id":"78bf2ec267a1c34b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-self-reference]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth","status":"resolved","id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TruthTeller}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\n\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\tau\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\n\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\,\n\\operatorname{TruthTeller}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x) = T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau \\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":3096,"backlinks":[{"id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b350e567d372da0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"417cabd731eca511","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 